  "description": "UQAMOR crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C95 H94 Dy4 Mn4 N12 O45,3(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.584-4.016 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.79-123.61°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4III Mn4III (OH)2 (O2C2H3)3 (shi)4 (H2shi)4 (Hsal)3 (DMF)4]·3DMF. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II), I(II).",
